@DeChimex.Host_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046

# De-Chimex Print Hub — HTTP request file.
# The default /weatherforecast template line was removed (2026-09-05): this project has
# no such endpoint. These are the ONLY three surviving /api/v1 actions (the other 22 API
# controllers were removed on 2026-08-30/2026-09-01 as superseded by the MVC UI).
# Everything else is a server-rendered MVC page — open it in a browser, not here.

### Public bootstrap config (anonymous). Exposes the Paystack PUBLIC key only.
GET {{DeChimex.Host_HostAddress}}/api/v1/config
Accept: application/json

### Public storefront business info (anonymous).
GET {{DeChimex.Host_HostAddress}}/api/v1/settings/public
Accept: application/json

### Paystack server-to-server webhook (anonymous; signature verified from
### x-paystack-signature before any state change). Always answers 200 to acknowledge.
### Replace the body with a real signed charge.success payload when testing manually.
POST {{DeChimex.Host_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/webhook/paystack
Content-Type: application/json
x-paystack-signature: replace-with-valid-hmac-sha512

{
  "event": "charge.success",
  "data": {
    "reference": "replace-with-payment-reference",
    "status": "success",
    "amount": 10000,
    "currency": "NGN"
  }
}

### Health check. 503 with database=Healthy while Paystack/Brevo keys are blank.
GET {{DeChimex.Host_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only).
GET {{DeChimex.Host_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### MVC entry points (browser pages — listed for reference, not JSON APIs):
###   /                      storefront home
###   /products  /services  /gallery  /cart  /checkout
###   /Account/Login         staff + customer sign-in (owner@dechimexprinthub.com)
###   /admin/dashboard       staff dashboard (302 -> /Account/Login when anonymous)
###   /portal                customer portal     (302 -> /Account/Login when anonymous)
